item(118,'other',[],'not applicable: research-process record','','The earlier run records missing contextual files, partial source-retrieval failures and integrity checks of its own transcription package.','These are reports about that run. They neither certify this consolidation nor prove any unresolved mathematical claim.','not on the page','Kept as provenance, with no transfer of the earlier run’s hash or proof checks.')
